// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1574.008
// Description: Detects using SettingSyncHost.exe to run hijacked binary
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (not (((process.executable startswith "C:\\Windows\\System32\\" or process.executable startswith "C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\"))) and ((process.parent.command_line like "*_cmd.exe /c*" and process.parent.command_line like "*_RoamDiag.cmd*" and process.parent.command_line like "*_-outputpath*")))
